# PLACEHOLDER conversation (workstream Q). Not story: Steven writes the real one.
# The shape to copy: two levels, three responses each, one right path, a give at the end.
# Grammar: design/godot-dialogue.md.

~ start
if placeholder_sound_shop_done
	PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line: already done, {{name}}.
	=> END
PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line 1, {{name}}.
PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line 2 (a question).
- PLACEHOLDER response 1 (wrong)
	PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line: wrong path 1.
	=> END
- PLACEHOLDER response 2 (right path)
	PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line 3 (a second question).
	- PLACEHOLDER response 2.1 (wrong)
		PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line: wrong path 2.1.
		=> END
	- PLACEHOLDER response 2.2 (right path)
		PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line 4.
		set placeholder_sound_shop_done = true
		give rs_microcassette
		PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line 5 (after the give).
		=> END
	- PLACEHOLDER response 2.3 (wrong)
		PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line: wrong path 2.3.
		=> END
- PLACEHOLDER response 3 (wrong)
	PLACEHOLDER Sound Shop attendant: PLACEHOLDER line: wrong path 3.
	=> END
